      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Honestly I'd like to have Focus Mode in VR too. It sucks when I'm listening to someone performing music in the Black Cat and then the Black Cat music starts playing and I have to get up and go back over to the signposts to turn it off. Although, at that point maybe World Expressions would be a better solution...",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
