  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-04-24T23:11:55.312Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I'm interested in using the Focus Mode feature for Desktop users too. In my use case, I would like to use it for video screens.\n\nI would like to avoid using other solutions like putting the head of your avatar in a box or other screen space shader tricks. I want to use official and maintained VRChat conventions.\n\nI understand that Focus Mode would have to work differently for Desktop. And it would have additional considerations. Something that reaches my goal of being able to draw a region around an arbitrary area and have the VRChat interaction/UI systems provide \"Focus Mode-like\" controls (zoom in/zoom out) would be enough.",
